@startuml
title Signal groupings - illustrative, not the MRI operational dimension taxonomy
package "Capability" {
  component Ownership
  component Value
  component Learning
}
package "Flow" {
  component Backlog
  component Predictability
  component DeliveryRate
}
package "Team environment" {
  component Safety
  component Collaboration
  component Improvement
}
package "System" {
  component Alignment
  component Autonomy
  component Leadership
}
note bottom
  Illustrative groupings, not a claim that every signal
  is implemented or that these signal groups are comparable.
  The MRI operational dimensions are a separate taxonomy.
  Evidence may also be used directly, without a signal.
  Normalisation is optional and purpose-driven.
end note
@enduml
